# U22: a build whose Notes section has text (NotesTab:Load: SetText of the XML text node,
# lastContent), shown and hidden codes over the loaded ^x / ^digit codes, a switch to another
# tab (Ctrl+1) and back (the Notes edit keeps its state), typing after a hide, Ctrl+S, and a
# second Ctrl+S with nothing changed.
#! u22-saved Builds/notes_build.xml
#! u22-expect-notes ^xFF0000Leveling^7 notes
fixture userdir=user
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press 6
key-up CTRL
frames 2
move 1190 112
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 1
frames 1
press 6
key-up CTRL
frames 2
move 1190 112
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 600 300
click LEFTBUTTON
key-down CTRL
press END
key-up CTRL
type " ^5end"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press s
key-up CTRL
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press s
key-up CTRL
frames 2
snapshot saved
frames 1
